     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.display [ fhir:value "Syrup" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Liquid, single-dose or multidose aqueous preparation characterised by a sweet taste and a viscous consistency and usually containing aromatic or other flavouring agents, intended for oral use. Each dose from a multidose container is administered by means of a device suitable for measuring the prescribed volume. The device is usually a spoon or a cup for volumes of 5 mL or multiples thereof or an oral syringe for other volumes." ] ;
