     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.display [ fhir:value "Ophthalmic insert" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Solid sterile preparation of suitable size and shape, designed to be inserted in the conjunctival sac to produce a local or ocular effect by the release of active substance(s) over a determined period of time. Ophthalmic inserts generally consist of a reservoir of active substance(s) embedded in a matrix or bounded by a rate-controlling membrane. They are presented individually in sterile containers." ] ;
