     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.display [ fhir:value "Sealant matrix" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Solid sterile preparation consisting of a pliable piece of material impregnated or coated with a sealant or with a powder that forms a sealant after contact with an appropriate fluid (e.g. blood). It may act as a haemostatic agent and/or tissue glue. The matrix may itself form part of the seal, and is usually absorbed by the body over time." ] ;
