     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Single-dose preparation consisting of granules enclosed in a capsule resembling a hard capsule. The capsule is to be opened and its entire contents administered orally. The capsule itself is not swallowed and is discarded after opening. For preparations consisting of a capsule that may either be swallowed whole or be opened, the term 'Hard capsule' is used instead." ] ;
