     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.display [ fhir:value "Unit-dose blister" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Container consisting of two layers of which one is shaped to contain the individual unit, usually provided with perforations, the intention being to allow each individual unit to be separated for single unit administration. All the information required for blister packs must appear on each unit dose presentation. Blisters and strips are excluded." ] ;
